	(text "USER USB-C: receptacle J901 (16-pin USB 2.0), VBUS TVS D903, data-line ESD U902. VBUS_USER_RAW and CC1/CC2\ngo to the STUSB4500 PD sink on the Power Input sheet. D+/D- (USB_90R pair) -> CP2102N (self-powered from\n3V3_PERIPH), VBUS sense from VBUS_USER through 22.1k/47.5k. TXD/RXD to P4 UART1 (GPIO22/21).\nGPIO.0/GPIO.1 = TX/RX activity LEDs (default CP2102N configuration). The UART is only live when the board is on."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 233.68 0)
